    "title": "Northwood names Calvary alum, Loyola assistant as its new baseball coach - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ROY LANG III ,\n8 hours ago The Northwood Falcons named Cole Downey as its baseball coach Wednesday. Downey served as an assistant to Loyola head coach Morgan Brian this season and spent four years at his alma mater, Calvary (2019-2022). Downey founded the First Baptist Middle School program and spent three years there (2023-25). “This opportunity... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
